  "description": "Productbeschrijving<br>\r\nSet 50 TV consists of an infra-red mono stethoset receiver and infra-red transmitter that is ideal for listening to TV sound within a room, up to a distance of 12 metres.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt features a power/volume and balance control on the receiver offering great convenience with intuitive operation and is excellent value for money with its exceptional connectivity to a TV set or hi-fi system.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nFeatures<br>\r\n- Ideal for TV sound transmission<br>\r\n- Cordless infra-red system with excellent sound quality<br>\r\n- Very good speech intelligibility, good reproduction quality<br>\r\n- Transmits sound within a room at a distance of up to 12 meters<br>\r\n- Balance control on the headphones for separately setting the volume level for the left and right ear.<br>\r\n- NiMH rechargeable battery (''accupack'') for more than 9 hrs. of audio enjoyment<br>\r\n- Transmitter recharges the headphones plus an additional accupack<br>\r\n- Includes short instructions for quick set-up<br>\r\n- Very lightweight stethoset headphones, extremely comfortable to wear even for extended listening<br>\r\n- Ideal for wearers of glasses.",
